{:edb/db-before-t 1970 :edb/db-after-t 1971 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535283 50 #inst "2026-10-13T13:50:40.326Z" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186064283 1038 #edb/ref 17592186490484 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186064283 1038 #edb/ref 17592186490486 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186064283 1038 #edb/ref 17592186490490 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186064283 1040 #edb/ref 17592186490497 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490484 1068 #edb/ref 17592186490495 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490484 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490484 1071 "Given that $f(x)={sin}^{4}⁡(x),$ we have\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}." 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490484 1072 #uuid "140dd45d-8107-5dae-9564-2bd6cb1a4f7b" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490484 1074 "First, we express\n\n$$\nf(x)=(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x))^{4}.\n$$\n\nNow, we see that $f(x)$ can be expressed as the composite function\n\n$$\nf={u}^{4},\\,u=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x).\n$$\n\nDifferentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}=4{u}^{3},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x).\n$$\n\nWe now apply the chain rule, and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =4{u}^{3}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(x) \\\\  & =4{sin}^{3}⁡(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490485 1080 "-6{sin}^{5}⁡x" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490485 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490485 1083 #uuid "15ed3388-c369-5661-8011-9ad85b8a7185" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490486 1068 #edb/ref 17592186490493 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490486 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490486 1071 "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ when $f(x)={cos}^{6}⁡(x).$" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490486 1072 #uuid "1da4f94b-c6e6-57bb-95c9-efc33159af10" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490486 1074 "First, we express\n\n$$\nf(x)=(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)^{6}.\n$$\n\nNow, we see that $f(x)$ can be expressed as the composite function\n\n$$\nf={u}^{6},\\,u=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}=6{u}^{5}\\,\\text{and}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\n$$\n\nWe now apply the chain rule, and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =6{u}^{5}\\cdot (-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & =-6{u}^{5}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\  & =-6(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)^{5}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\  & =-6{cos}^{5}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490487 1080 "6{cos}^{5}⁡x\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡x" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490487 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490487 1083 #uuid "1fefddaa-9b00-592c-976c-b15111b07144" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490488 1080 "4{sin}^{3}(x)\\operatorname{cos}(x)" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490488 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490488 1083 #uuid "48f64a5c-9e09-59b8-b17f-a73c876d2ddb" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490489 1080 "6{cos}^{5}⁡x" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490489 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490489 1083 #uuid "4ccb1a92-1ab5-55f6-a051-1d41270340a7" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490490 1068 #edb/ref 17592186490492 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490490 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490490 1071 "Given that $f(x)=-2{cos}^{6}⁡(x),$ we have\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}." 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490490 1072 #uuid "65409563-6aa3-541a-86d5-30b4fe746231" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490490 1074 "First, we express\n\n$$\nf(x)=-2(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x))^{6}.\n$$\n\nNow, we see that $f(x)$ can be expressed as the composite function\n\n$$\nf=-2{u}^{6},\\,u=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x).\n$$\n\nDifferentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}=-12{u}^{5},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x).\n$$\n\nWe now apply the chain rule, and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =-12{u}^{5}\\cdot (-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)) \\\\  & =12{cos}^{5}⁡(x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490491 1080 "12{cos}^{5}(x)\\operatorname{sin}(x)" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490491 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490491 1083 #uuid "67b6c87a-70ca-5491-baa9-b7ba9b113855" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490492 1075 #edb/ref 17592186490491 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490492 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490492 1077 "field-1" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490492 1078 #edb/ref 17592186490491 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490492 1079 #uuid "8e0e8dd8-ac9c-5253-9528-54ce170da5b3" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490493 1075 #edb/ref 17592186490485 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490493 1075 #edb/ref 17592186490487 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490493 1075 #edb/ref 17592186490489 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490493 1075 #edb/ref 17592186490494 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490493 1075 #edb/ref 17592186490496 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490493 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [17592186490493 1077 "selection" 13194139535283 17592186045443 true] [1759218649049